# Scope

Do not build: cloud/remote rendering, a store, library sync, monetization, anti-cheat titles, online multiplayer, a 10-title matrix, a compatibility control panel, or brand polish beyond functional.

Follow `docs/MILESTONES.md`. Do not invent week-based plans.

## License

GPTK is eval-only on our Macs. Do not vendor Apple's toolkit or require users to install it. Do not copy CrossOver internals. See `docs/LEGAL.md`. Local GPTK/CrossOver installs for M0 testing are expected.

## Git hygiene

Never commit game binaries, Steam libraries, prefixes, GPTK/CrossOver apps, DMGs, shader caches, or secrets.

## UI copy

User-visible strings: Play, Installing, Updating, Running. Never toolkit, bottle, prefix, or Windows-version names.
